[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4874162161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120881#issuecomment-4874162161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120881","id":4874162161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIoXP8Q","user":{"login":"hubacekjakub","id":6129076,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjkwNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6129076?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub","html_url":"https://github.com/hubacekjakub","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubacekjakub/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T08:08:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T08:08:58Z","body":"Some more information about the issue.\n\n- This was working in Godot 3.2.1 (used `WS_EX_LAYERED` for transparency)\n- 3.2.2-beta3 switched to `DwmEnableBlurBehindWindow` for performance ([#38629](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/38629)) (cc @bruvzg @Technohacker)\n- This is intentional, it was solving issue with performance of `WS_EX_LAYERED` window\n- There is `polygon passthrough` but that does not work for me as well (also thats for different use-case)\n\nI would like to discuss this first, then if everybody agrees I would like to work on PR which will tackle with this issue. My aim would be keep `DwmEnableBlurBehindWindow` approach which is performance win.\n\nAlso its fair to say that this issue is only for fraction of engine users. It could be categorized as desktop overlay application:\n- desktop pets\n- desktop widgets\n- game overlays\n- dashboard displays\n\n Any application which renders on top of the other applications but does not steal the input. \n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4874162161/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4874346282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120881#issuecomment-4874346282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120881","id":4874346282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIoifKg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T08:34:05Z","updated_at